{
    "$description": "Non-token configuration of the semantic colour layer; the tokens are in the *.tokens.json files next to it. modes: the value sets and their CSS selectors. rampPairs: today primitive ramp to designer palette ramp (the rule-derived fallback of an unverified today value; read in reverse by primitiveRemap). renames: Figma token name to code name (several Figma names may share one code name only when their values are identical). additions: the code-only tokens (not in the designer's Figma collection) in output order, each with the consumer that relies on it (usedBy). utilities and primitiveRemap: see their own descriptions.",
    "modes": {
        "today": {
            "file": "semantic.today.tokens.json",
            "selector": ":root"
        },
        "next": {
            "file": "semantic.next.tokens.json",
            "selector": "[data-theme=\"next\"]"
        },
        "dark": {
            "file": "semantic.dark.tokens.json",
            "selector": "[data-theme=\"dark\"]"
        }
    },
    "rampPairs": {
